OL,5,G0005 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FThe police turn up at Val's place
OL,7,     Fand arrest Bea, returning her to
OL,8,     FWentworth where she is welcomed
OL,9,     Fback by Doreen. Monnie is still
OL,10,     Fadamant she's in charge.
OL,11,G0105 Murder She Wrote
OL,12,     F...Possibly. Tempers flare in
OL,13,     FCabot Cove over the planned
OL,14,     Fconstruction of a hotel, and a
OL,15,     Ftycoon with many enemies is found
OL,16,     Fdead on the building site of his
OL,17,     Fhigh-rise hotel.
OL,18,G0210 Murder She Wrote
OL,19,     FJessica's niece, who acts in a
OL,20,     Fsoap opera, comes under suspicion
OL,21,     Fwhen an onscreen 'victim' is
OL,22,     Fdiscovered to really be dead.
